    "summary": "Opponent’s Shooting Phase. After an enemy unit picks its shooting targets, choose an AELDARI INFANTRY unit of yours it picked. Your army must control an objective marker with its range reaching that unit. Through this phase it gains Stealth, and enemy models more than 18″ away cannot pick it as a ranged attack target.",
